      (separates "the wall steps in at (3,3), a bend whose outward diagonal points into the pocket: every bend casts, inward one included, painting over the bottom arm; only convex bends cast; inward ray stops at the arm; inward ray skips the arm; rays from the core's corner cross the step and paint over the arm's bend")
      (input (grid
        (3 3 0 9 0 0 0 0 0 0)
        (3 3 0 9 0 0 0 0 0 0)
        (0 0 0 9 0 0 0 0 0 0)
        (0 0 0 9 9 9 0 0 0 0)
